%v\", eventType, err)\n520|\t}\n521|\treturn reference.EventID\n522|}\n523|\n524|// --- journal fixtures ---\n525|\n526|// journalFixture creates a journal over one workspace authority and\n527|// walks it to committed: the after-restore step-3 valid\n528|// materialization. No managed replica participates, so no marker\n529|// evidence is required; no provider or bridge participates, so only\n530|// the authority leg must commit.\n531|func journalFixture(t *testing.T, store *matjournal.Store) matjournal.Journal {\n532|\tt.Helper()\n533|\trequest := []byte(`{\"materialization_id\":\"` + fixtureMat + `\",\"operation_id\":\"` + fixturePrepareOp + `\",\"plan_id\":\"` + seedDigest(0xD1) + `\"}`)\n534|\tinputs := matjournal.CreateInputs{\n535|\t\tMaterializationID:  fixtureMat,\n536|\t\tPrepareOperationID: fixturePrepareOp,\n537|\t\tRequestBody:        request,\n538|\t\tPlanID:             seedDigest(0xD1),\n539|\t\tSourceCheckpointID: seedDigest(0xD2),\n540|\t\tPlan: []matjournal.PlanAuthority{\n541|\t\t\t{ID: \"workspace_relux\", Kind: matjournal.PlanKindWorkspace, Platform: \"linux\", RootPath: \"/home/ivan/work/relux\"},\n542|\t\t},\n543|\t\tHostPlatform: \"linux\",\n544|\t\tExtensions:   map[string]string{},\n545|\t}\n546|\tif _, _, err := store.Create(inputs); err != nil {\n547|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"Create() error = %v\", err)\n548|\t}\n549|\tfor _, phase := range []string{matjournal.PhaseValidating, matjournal.PhasePrepared, matjournal.PhaseCommitting} {\n550|\t\tif _, err := store.Transition(fixtureMat, phase, matjournal.TransitionOpts{}); err != nil {\n551|\t\t\tt.Fatalf(\"Transition(%s) error = %v\", phase, err)\n552|\t\t}\n553|\t}\n554|\trollback := \"/home/ivan/work/relux.prior\"\n555|\tif _, err := store.UpdateAuthority(fixtureMat, \"workspace_relux\", matjournal.AuthorityState{\n556|\t\tRootPath:           \"/home/ivan/work/relux\",\n557|\t\tCompletedSequences: []uint64{1},\n558|\t\tRollbackRoot:       &rollback,\n559|\t\tState:              matjournal.AuthorityPrepared,\n560|\t}); err != nil {\n561|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"UpdateAuthority(prepared) error = %v\", err)\n562|\t}\n563|\tif _, err := store.UpdateAuthority(fixtureMat, \"workspace_relux\", matjournal.AuthorityState{\n564|\t\tRootPath:           \"/home/ivan/work/relux\",\n565|\t\tCompletedSequences: []uint64{1},\n566|\t\tState:              matjournal.AuthorityCommitted,\n567|\t}); err != nil {\n568|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"UpdateAuthority(committed) error = %v\", err)\n569|\t}\n570|\tjournal, err := store.Transition(fixtureMat, matjournal.PhaseCommitted, matjournal.TransitionOpts{})\n571|\tif err != nil {\n572|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"Transition(committed) error = %v\", err)\n573|\t}\n574|\treturn journal\n575|}\n576|\n577|// --- checkpoint fixtures ---\n578|\n579|// checkpointFixture captures a direct checkpoint over the chain\n580|// fixture heads and returns its digest and bytes.\n581|func checkpointFixture(t *testing.T, repository *sessrepo.Repository, store *sessckpt.Store, heads []string) (string, []byte) {\n582|\tt.Helper()\n583|\treference, raw, err := store.Capture(repository, sessckpt.Inputs{\n584|\t\tOperationID:         fixtureBootstrap,\n585|\t\tSessionID:           fixtureSession,\n586|\t\tSessionKind:         sessckpt.SessionKindDirect,\n587|\t\tLeaseEpoch:          1,\n588|\t\tLeaseID:             fixtureLeaseA,\n589|\t\tCreatorHostID:       fixtureLocalHost,\n590|\t\tWorkspaceManifestID: seedDigest(0xE1),\n591|\t\tProviderManifestID:  seedDigest(0xE2),\n592|\t\tBoundary: sessckpt.SafeBoundary{\n593|\t\t\tProviderID:          \"codex\",\n594|\t\t\tProviderVersion:     \"0.147.0\",\n595|\t\t\tEvidence:            sessckpt.EvidenceAcceptedTest,\n596|\t\t\tInputBlocked:        true,\n597|\t\t\tForegroundIdle:      true,\n598|\t\t\tBackgroundIdle:      true,\n599|\t\t\tOpenProcesses:       0,\n600|\t\t\tOpenDatabaseHandles: 0,\n601|\t\t},\n602|\t\tEventHeads: heads,\n603|\t\tCreatedAt:  fixtureCreatedAt,\n604|\t\tExtensions: map[string]string{},\n605|\t})\n606|\tif err != nil {\n607|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"Capture() error = %v\", err)\n608|\t}\n609|\treturn reference.CheckpointID, raw\n610|}\n611|\n612|var errFixtureConfig = errors.New(\"fixture configuration is invalid\")","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
